  <page_number>54</page_number>
  <running_head>CANTICVM</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Spes fallit recubans Diis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2" para="true">
      <i>Quales artificum dextra dolat sagax.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Hoc sentit Superi simul</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Debellata ruit robore iudicis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Speratam neque Numinis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">
      <i>Uani cernit opem rebus in asperis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>Sed qua Gens, velut incluta</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Vitis, ferre suo tempore debuit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Vvas fertilis uberes:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Vinum vipereo felle nocentius,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Et quovis mage toxico.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Fructus mortiferos degener attulit.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Quales nunc Sodomæ nigris</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Ambusta videas crescere collibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Gomorrhæque simul solo,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Quas urbes Superum dextera perdidit:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Et tandem scelere horrido</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Turpes fulmineis subruit ignibus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Vvis dulcia talibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>Si quis vina putat carpere, fallitur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Non fel tabificum acrius.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Non plus dente nocet Vipera sontico[?].</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Qua Rex cuncta videt potens</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Cœlorum &amp; memori pectore connotat:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Signatas velut impiger</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Qui gazas validis clavibus obserat.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" para="true">
      <i>Summis Cœlituum Deus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28" para="true">
      <i>Terras Imperiis qui regit arbiter,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">
      <i>Tristi supplicio nefas</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Doubtful readings: "sontico" (line 22) is unclear; the first letter may be f. "Vvas" and "Vvis" are printed with u-shaped V forms; rendered as consonantal v per the spelling rules. The ct ligature in "cuncta" and "fructus" is resolved to plain letters. The circular stamp in the right margin and the show-through from the other side are omitted. The page ends mid-poem, so no catchword is given.</notes>
